 solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-6" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:FinancingReceivableRecordedInvestment90DaysPastDueAndStillAccruing" format="ixt:fixed-zero" scale="3" id="f-828">&#8212;</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:0 1pt"/><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-6" decimals="-3" name="opbk:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestPastDue" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="f-829">7,820</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr><tr style="height:3pt"><td colspan="21" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:3pt double #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:3pt double #000;padding:0 1pt"/></tr></table></div><div style="padding-left:18pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.85pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;position:relative;top:-3.15pt;vertical-align:baseline">(1)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Excludes guaranteed portion of loans of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-147" decimals="-5" name="opbk:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestPastDue" scale="6" id="f-830">20.9</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-148" decimals="-5" name="opbk:FinancingReceivableExcludingAccruedInterestPastDue" scale="6" id="f-831">16.3</ix:nonFraction> million as of December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, respectively.</span></div></ix:nonNumeric><div style="margin-top:12pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Nonaccrual loans and loans past due 90 or more include both (i) loans with similar risk characteristics that are collectively evaluated for allowance, and (ii) loans that do not share similar risk characteristics that are individually evaluated for allowance. Under the Company's policy, nonaccrual loans with outstanding balances above the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-1" decimals="-3" name="opbk:FinancingReceivableNonaccrualLoansRiskCharacteristicsThreshold" scale="3" id="f-832">500</ix:nonFraction>&#160;thousand threshold that lack shared risk characteristics are subject to individual evaluation for expected credit losses.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-we